il agile reflexes this  means he already suffered the chemical  accident as a kid that left him blind  and perhaps he also worked with a  version of stick maybe scott glenn's  version who taught him how to use his  other senses and enhance his reflexes  and then as a lawyer he has also already  established the firm of nelson and  murdoch with foggy nelson most likely in  which case it's gonna be a bit weird to  see someone else other than eldon hinson  play that character alongside charlie  cox so hopefully they bring him back too  it's just not yet clear if this matt  murdock has officially become the devil  of hell's kitchen or if he has crossed  paths with wilson fisk i'm going to  assume no or they're in their early  throws of their conflict because as soon  as these two heavyweights become aware  of each other it's not long before one  of them ends up incarcerated or severely  incapacitated by late 2024 when hawkeye  and no way home take place concurrently  as rogers the musical is running in new  york in both titles both men are active  and mostly unbruised but again this is  an alternate reality so now the mcu can  really pick and choose which of the  netflix plot threads to make part of the  mcu daredevil's backstory maybe he  already knows frank castle and jessica  jones and luke cage or maybe he hasn't  met them yet maybe he hasn't yet battled  with the hand or even knows what the  hand is maybe he's tried to hit kingpin  before but kingpin walked away unscathed  so that's why i think it's so important  to re-watch these series when they drop  on disney plus because anything and  everything we liked about them could  come back as part of the canonical  backstory for daredevil for kingpin for  anyone else who's now in the mcu  actually keep an eye out for this  sunday's episode of big question where  they're gonna look at all of the netflix  marvel titles to see which titles are  most likely to cross over into the mcu  as we look ahead you can follow me on 